WEBVTT

00:06:27.996 --> 00:06:30.996
and we've never had the right
to sue the government before."

00:06:31.596 --> 00:06:34.916
ClientEarth, on the other hand,
sues governments all the time.

00:06:34.956 --> 00:06:36.076
(Laughter)

00:06:36.116 --> 00:06:41.676
So they were asking us
to share with them

00:06:41.716 --> 00:06:44.196
our experience of suing governments.

00:06:44.676 --> 00:06:49.916
This was the Chinese federal prosecutors
asking us to train them

00:06:49.956 --> 00:06:51.956
to sue the Chinese government.

00:06:51.996 --> 00:06:53.796
(Laughter)

00:06:53.836 --> 00:06:56.276
It is the most amazing request
I've ever had.

00:06:56.316 --> 00:06:57.476
(Laughter)

00:06:57.516 --> 00:06:59.796
So, of course, we started
working with them.